#: ../../openmvcam/shields/wifi-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/wifi-shield.rst:6
msgid "WiFi Shield"
msgstr "WiFi Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/wifi-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The WiFi Shield adds 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi to OpenMV Cams that don't have on-board "
"networking, using the Atmel WINC1500 module. It plugs into the bottom of any"
" OpenMV Cam header."
msgstr ""
"WiFi Shield menambahkan Wi-Fi 2,4 GHz ke OpenMV Cam yang tidak memiliki "
"jaringan on-board, menggunakan modul Atmel WINC1500. Shield ini dapat "
"dipasang ke bagian bawah header OpenMV Cam mana pun."

